  "description": "Stop using legacy 3D gray WinForms buttons. ModernButtons.WinForms provides hardware-accelerated, anti-aliased Modern Buttons for Windows Forms. Features smooth rounded corners, glowing hover and press state animations, native Dark Mode, and 5 premium design styles. Seamlessly inherits native WinForms Button properties for perfect DialogResult routing, Click events, and AcceptButton/CancelButton form integration.",
