  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 Initial Stable Release:\n\t\t\t- Launched ModernButton featuring anti-aliased rounded corners, hover/press state animations, and native DialogResult routing.\n\t\t\t- Supports Primary (filled) and Secondary (outlined) rendering modes.\n\t\t\t- Native Dark/Light mode integration with 5 Podargus core design styles.\n\t\t\t- High-DPI support and zero-flicker double-buffered rendering.",
